title: A Divided Caucus
subtitle: One of our wings is furious. Calm it before it walks out.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_disunity.svg
view-if: disunity_timer <= 0 and cw_furious
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; disunity_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "disunity"
new-page: true
on-display: {! SW.cardStuck(Q, this); !}

= A Divided Caucus

[+ cw_divided +]

- @discipline: Enforce discipline.
- @concede: Give the angriest faction what it wants.
- @convention: Hold an open convention.
- @easy_discard
- @set_aside

@discipline
subtitle: −1 political capital. Everyone calms down a little.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rad_inst -= 8; rad_rimward -= 8; rad_pacifist -= 8; rad_hawk -= 8

The whips are out. The Caucus falls into line, grudgingly.

@concede
subtitle: The angriest wing calms down a great deal; the others resent it.
on-arrival: {!
var worst = 'inst', v = -1;
for (var i = 0; i < SW.FACTIONS.length; i++) { var f = SW.FACTIONS[i]; if (SW.factionActive(Q, f) && Q['rad_' + f] > v) { v = Q['rad_' + f]; worst = f; } }
for (var j = 0; j < SW.FACTIONS.length; j++) { var g = SW.FACTIONS[j]; Q['rad_' + g] = Math.max(0, Q['rad_' + g] + (g === worst ? -18 : 4)); }
Q[worst + '_strength'] += 3;
Q.conceded_to = SW.FACTION_NAMES[worst];
!}

The Caucus gives the [+ conceded_to +] what they have been demanding. They are mollified. Everyone else takes note.

@convention
subtitle: −2 political capital. Broad relief, and a little more faith.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2; rad_inst -= 11; rad_rimward -= 11; rad_pacifist -= 11; rad_hawk -= 11; faith += 0.5

A long, open convention airs every grievance. It is exhausting, and it works.
